  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The London Borough of Hounslow as the Local Planning Authority hereby certify that on 10 March 2025, the existing use of 136 Springwell Road, Hounslow, TW5 9BP as a small House in Multiple Occupation (Use Class C4) shown on drawings submitted on 26/02/2025 and numbered 01, 02, 03 was lawful within the meaning of Section 191 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 for the following reason:\nThe existing use would comply with the requirements of Schedule 2, Part 3, Class L of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended) and it has been demonstrated, on the balance of probability, that this use commenced prior to the Article 4 Direction coming into effect."
  ],
